{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38886","headline":"友人赠舍弟依韵戏和 · 杜荀鹤","name":"友人赠舍弟依韵戏和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾家此弟有何知，多媿君开道业基。\n不觉裹头成大汉，昨来竹马作童儿。\n还缘世遇兵戈闹，祗恐身修礼乐迟。\n及见和诗诗自好，碢公不到更何时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38886.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38886","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}